@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@
+# Azure credential helper compatibility backport
+
+Library sources and license are copied from the immutable public module
+`github.com/chrismellard/docker-credential-acr-env`
+`v0.0.0-20230304212654-82a0ddb27589` (commit
+`82a0ddb27589`). The module path is retained for existing Sigstore callers.
+Only the library packages, original module declaration and license are included;
+the standalone command and its release tooling are not used by this controller.
+
+The local change anchors all four Azure registry suffixes to the complete host,
+following the fix in the maintained successor's
+[`v1.0.0` release](https://github.com/osscontainertools/docker-credential-acr/blob/v1.0.0/pkg/credhelper/helper.go).
+That successor requires Go 1.27; this backport retains the released controller's
+Go 1.26 compatibility. Credential acquisition, token exchange, authentication
+and supported registry suffixes are unchanged.
+
+The original host tests and added credential-entry boundary regression run from
+the consumer module during the controller image build. No test uses credentials
+or contacts Azure.
